/* The PostgreSQL component, resolved together with the recipe's own plan
   (share/product.mk, root.spec). The shared tree had no plans/turnkey/pgsql:
   mk/turnkey/pgsql.mk brought the overlay and the conf script, and the
   package names lived in each recipe. They belong with the component, so
   this is where they are now.

   postgresql is the server as Debian 13 ships it; webmin-postgresql is the
   module that puts the database in the Webmin panel core already carries. A
   client is not here on purpose: a recipe that talks to its own database
   asks for one, and keel-postgresql does. */

postgresql
webmin-postgresql
